dsh-desktop-notify README · 10.3 What it does instead: observe the official state source：- `pendingInteraction.kind` already discriminates `approval` / `question` / `plan-review` and carries `toolName` / `reason` / `questions`, so all three cases come from one read;
- reading state is **ordering-free** and outside the answering path, which is what makes the zero-intrusion claim true;
- decoupling from the waterfall is also what makes foreground suppression and blur-time flushing possible at all.
